        "mobile_bottom": -1,
        "heading": "Competitive Insight:",
        "sub_heading": "",
        "text": "<p>Our Growth Shopify package is designed to match (and often beat) what’s available in the market for similar custom-built eCommerce websites.</p><p>Where other agencies might price mid-tier stores anywhere from A$7K–$12K, our Growth Package keeps you firmly in the $6K–$9K range without cutting corners.</p><p>You get a fully custom look, SEO included, abandoned cart flows, and essential app setups that many competitors only offer as paid add-ons.</p><p>Because we do everything in-house (100% Australian-based, no outsourcing), the quality stays high, and the timeline stays tight – and you avoid the common pitfalls of generic templates or overseas freelancers.</p>",
